WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:01.110
Hello.

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:04.310
Customers can only book while your salon is open,

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.950
so setting your opening hours correctly comes first before you take

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:09.670
bookings online.

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:11.990
It only takes a minute.

00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:14.228
Tap opening hours in the menu

00:00:14.978 --> 00:00:16.508
under weekly schedule.

00:00:16.458 --> 00:00:18.868
The fastest way is a quick preset.

00:00:18.978 --> 00:00:22.068
For example, Monday to Saturday, 9 to 7,

00:00:22.818 --> 00:00:24.468
every day is filled in at once.

00:00:25.149 --> 00:00:29.359
To adjust a single day, use the switch to turn that day on or off.

00:00:29.789 --> 00:00:32.159
Then change the opening and closing times.

00:00:32.989 --> 00:00:37.359
If you close for lunch, tap Add shift to get a second shift that

00:00:37.309 --> 00:00:37.679
day.

00:00:38.509 --> 00:00:41.039
When you're done, tap save opening hours.

00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:44.084
Further down is Holidays and Closed Days.

00:00:44.754 --> 00:00:47.924
Choose from and to if you are closed for several days,

00:00:48.274 --> 00:00:51.124
write the reason and tap add Closed Days.

00:00:51.954 --> 00:00:55.044
Below are suggestions for upcoming public holidays.

00:00:55.554 --> 00:00:56.964
One tap adds them

00:00:57.634 --> 00:00:59.924
on these days customers can't book

00:01:00.754 --> 00:01:02.084
now. Take the quiz below.
